{"about_the_game":"Delve deep into the ancient Crystal Spire, a mechanical dungeon, as a customizable golem.<br>Mix and match elemental parts to master powerful abilities, and unravel the secrets of the luminous underworld in this rogue-like adventure<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/3eac09d711e7c0351bc21d0760dfe1ab.avif?t=1699611709\" width=617 height=88 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/562fe8b968f71df13a3e7c48b4920eb1.poster.avif?t=1699611709\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/562fe8b968f71df13a3e7c48b4920eb1.webm?t=1699611709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/562fe8b968f71df13a3e7c48b4920eb1.mp4?t=1699611709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the heart of the game is a unique customization mechanic. Each golem, representative of an elemental theme, possesses four distinct abilities tied to their body parts: arms, core, legs, and chest. <br><br>These correlate to a ranged ability, tactical ability, movement ability, and an ultimate ability respectively. <br><br>By swapping these parts between different golems, players can mix and match these abilities, creating a wide variety of strategic gameplay options.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/bab4cc12d37df491ab967b7d967b64a5.avif?t=1699611709\" width=617 height=88 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/cc72a906c88ee2db24f533e29ccf0972.poster.avif?t=1699611709\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/cc72a906c88ee2db24f533e29ccf0972.webm?t=1699611709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/cc72a906c88ee2db24f533e29ccf0972.mp4?t=1699611709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As a prospector use your vast arsenal of golems and magic tools to Delve into the Dungeon and unveil it\u2019s mysteries, get the legendary crystal at the heart of the Spire,<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/c8744274a0d80139af991e410325a306.avif?t=1699611709\" width=617 height=119 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/065b6f03095938aaee919a508a63a2dc.poster.avif?t=1699611709\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/065b6f03095938aaee919a508a63a2dc.webm?t=1699611709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/065b6f03095938aaee919a508a63a2dc.mp4?t=1699611709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The dungeon won\u2019t go down easily, a vast array of mechanical each have unique behaviors, providing varying challenges. The dungeon's structure evolves with each new playthrough, ensuring a fresh experience during each run.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590210/extras/f0e9b21c078e2456ae6fe04cf4a098d0.avif?t=1699611709\" width=617 height=119 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto